wnership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Dispersed Form","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The cathartic slime is in its condensed form and is beside or inside a body of water</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The cathartic slime disperses itself into the body of water, expanding its size to a maximum of a 20 foot cube. It can't expand into occupied squares. While in its dispersed form, the cathartic slime loses soften mind but gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Athletics checks to Grab and a +4 circumstance bonus to Stealth checks while it remains in the body of water. It also gains resistance 5 to bludgeoning and weakness 5 to electricity.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"dispersed-form","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"athletics","value":2,"type":"circumstance","predicate":["action:grapple","dispersed-form"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"stealth","value":4,"type":"circumstance","predicate":["dispersed-form"]},{"key":"Resistance","type":"bludgeoning","value":5,"predicate":["dispersed-form"]},{"key":"Weakness","type":"electricity","value":5,"predicate":["dispersed-form"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"pKGQuKyHaGQCJnBu","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.3"}},{"type":"action","name":"Emotional Drain","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} by the cathartic slime or has ingested water infested by the cathartic slime in its dispersed form</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The cathartic slime attempts to trap a creature in an emotional turmoil. The creature must attempt a @Check[will|dc:22] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and is temporarily immune to Emotional Drain for 1 hour.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for up to 1 minute. It can attempt a @Check[will|dc:22] save at the end of each of its turns to end the condition.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for up to 1 minute. It can attempt a @Check[will|dc:22] save at the end of each of its turns to end the condition.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"WF4l6SAVp05A0L0B","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Soften Mind","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A creature hit by the cathartic slime's pseudopod or slime glob Strike must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:19] save or be @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round (or 1 minute on a critical failure).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"IdO1tjybvxvCBn0p","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Grab","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Grab]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"grab","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.Tkd8sH4pwFIPzqTr","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"KgXz1LWrlGW7AqrS"}],"effects":[],"sort":10500000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}